MANA³ Strava Processor
Cloud Run Function (europe-west1)

Receives raw Strava activity detail + streams + zones from S13.
Returns normalized metrics mapped to MANA³ 12-field system,
plus pre-built Notion payloads for Daily Record create/update.
"""

